#### Logout
POST {{url_dev}}/shop/logout
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
authorization: {{accessToken}}

#### Refresh token
POST {{url_dev}}/shop/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{clientId}}
x-rtoken-id: {{refreshToken}}

